        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Stops the Weather wallpaper from freezing on your Lock Screen & Home Screen.\n\nLets you change its animation speed, and lets you simulate any weather condition you want.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Features"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- **Unfreeze the Weather wallpaper**:\n\nDisables the freezing of the animations on the Weather wallpaper (Lock Screen & Home Screen).\n\n- **Animation speed**:\n\nAdjust the speed with a slider, up to 10 times faster ! (The iOS default is 1.00).\n\n- **Simulate the weather you want**:\n\nForce any weather condition (48 to choose from, or keep your local weather).\n\nForce the sky background to Auto, Day or Night.\n- **Lock Screen backlight**:\n\nCustomize or disable the Auto-Lock delay of the Lock Screen.\n\nThe delay resets when you touch or unlock the screen.\n- **10 languages**:\n\nEnglish, French, Spanish, German, Italian, Portuguese, Dutch, Russian, Simplified Chinese and Japanese.\n- Settings live in **Settings › Weather No Freeze**.\n\nA respring is needed to apply all changes.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
